<title>ESTONIA: TALLINN PORT CARGO RELOADINGS UP 18 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TALLINN PORT CARGO RELOADINGS UP 18 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinn Port said on Thursday it reloaded 8.019 tonnes of cargo in the first six months of this year, which is 18 percent higher compared to the same period last year.</p>
<p>In June, the port reloaded 1.437 tonnes of cargo compared to 1.387 tonnes in May, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
